              "text": "Differentialrechnung: Differenzenquotient "
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "tex": "\\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}",
              "speech": "Delta y durch Delta x"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "; Differentialquotient "
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "tex": "f'(x_0) = \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + h) - f(x_0)}{h}",
